    <guid isPermaLink="false">69dd06e9b977fb2c47d8b49e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>周杰伦新专辑《太阳之子》一出，Dayday、明昔以及百草枯，机缘巧合的凑到了一起——测评，吐槽，当然也毫不意外地聊跑题了。</span></p><p><span>三个青春里都绕不开周杰伦的主播，一边听新歌一边翻旧账。新专辑到底值几分？那些年的卡带、歌词本、边哭边笑听歌的夜晚......又是怎么被一首首旋律拽回来？</span></p><p><span>这期是关于周杰伦的，也是关于我们再也回不去的、却永远听得见的青春。</span></p><p><em><span>哦捏酱：姐姐驾到，生活有料。</span></em></p><p><span>＼Timeline＼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 《太阳之子》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 《西西里》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 《那天下雨了》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> 《湘女多情》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 《谁稀罕》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 《七月的极光》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 《爱琴海》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 《I Do》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3537">58:57</a> 《圣徒》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3832">1:03:52</a> 《女儿殿下》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4163">1:09:23</a> 《淘金小镇》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4371">1:12:51</a> 《乡间的路》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4518">1:15:18</a> 《圣诞星》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4861">1:21:01</a>整体评价</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5385">1:29:45</a> 周杰伦，我们的青春</span></p><p><span>关于周杰伦，你的青春是什么呢？</span></p><p><span>＼本期主播＼</span></p><p><span>Dayday &amp; 明昔 &amp; 百草枯</span></p>]]></description>
