    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c97e00a56ca3e0c4c2f7e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>秋天来啦！北京的秋是老舍笔下 “北平之秋即天堂” 的诗意 —— 天是澄澈的蓝，云是宫崎骏动画里蓬松的模样，银杏把街道染成金灿灿的海，香山红叶又添上一抹热烈的红，街头糖炒栗子的焦香、姑娘果糖葫芦的清甜；长沙的秋则带着 “秋老虎” 的调皮，高温常延续到国庆后，却也藏着惊喜 —— 一场秋雨过后，岳麓山的枫树悄悄红透，漫山红叶映着暖阳。那么趁着秋意正浓，我们邀你共赴一场 “秋日限定” 之约！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>哦捏酱：姐姐驾到，生活有料。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>＼Timeline＼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 北京：金色的秋天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 长沙：秋老虎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 老舍笔下 “北平之秋即天堂”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 岳麓山的枫树</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 秋天的第一杯奶茶，你喝了嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 糖炒栗子、烤红薯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 冰糖葫芦不止山楂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 北京涮羊肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 长沙的水果店琳琅满目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 秋天emo小情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 北京秋游限定：故宫里面捉迷藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 秋天天空的记忆是北京野生动物园限定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a> 长沙的秋天是记忆中的风吹麦浪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> 用金色的叶子做一朵金色的玫瑰花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 秋日养生茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 我们录的秋天的声音：明昔录的秋蝉&amp;Dayday录的出租车里听雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼本期主播＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dayday &amp; 明昔</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼片头＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：张大爷 作曲&amp;演奏</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲录制：大仑丁&amp;老王</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼片尾＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们录的秋天的声音：明昔录的秋蝉&amp;Dayday录的出租车里听雨</span></p>]]></description>
