    <title>每一个留学生都可以是六边形战士 | Vol.024</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b98dc397178f08ee48dcc8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b98dc397178f08ee48dcc8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到留学生，脑海里第一个蹦出来的是什么词？“娇留子”、“水硕水本“还是”花钱买学历”。这些偏见标签，掩盖了留学生活的真实。​其实，每个异国打拼的留学生，都是解锁六项技能的 “六边形战士”。 今天，留美6年的Day和法国交换生Miu，和大家分享成为 “六边形战士”的心路历程。快来听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼Timeline＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>六边形战士：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> ∠1 = 语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> ∠2 = 学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> ∠3 = 生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> ∠4 = 跨文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3546">59:06</a> ∠5 = 情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4117">68:37</a> ∠6 = 社交</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRrtRp7B9jTDAQmkv8fPhtEGpKE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Day &amp; Miu 的自我打分</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼本期主播＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dayday &amp; Miumiu</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼片头＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：张大爷 作曲&amp;演奏</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲录制：大仑丁&amp;老王</span></p><span></span><p><span>＼片尾＼</span></p><span></span><p><span>Memories -- Maroon 5</span></p>]]></description>
